Bind Npc 31558 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 31557 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 649 "Procurement of Specialty Goods IV"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Sailor] Hayes."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Sailor] Hein."
    Collect 3 of 389440000

Requires player level >= 64 and quest 648 is completed

Rewards
    Give 7500000 experience
    Give 10000 coins
    Give 1 of 900214000

direction_513 = location "Lamia" about "Lamia\nMust feed on fresh human blood; attacks all warriors in its vicinity" found "El Morad" at 610 1079 in zone 2
direction_514 = location "Lamia" about "Lamia\nMust feed on fresh human blood; attacks all warriors in its vicinity" found "Karus" at 1409 987 in zone 1

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Sailor] Hayes is looking for you again. He sent you off to Islant last time. What's he want now?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Sailor] Haine is looking for you again. He sent you off to Islant last time. What's he want now?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Tut, tut,tut...That fool... Oh, you are here."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The next thing I need to ask of you is a rare armor material called [Hard Snake Scale] which you can get from [Lamia]. This will be your last favor. Thank you for all your work.\n\n, From [Lamia], in accordance with the request of Karus Regional Executive pugeo port sailors and yes, you bring in solid snake scales."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Tut, tut,tut...That fool... Oh, you are here."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The next thing I need to ask of you is a rare armor material called [Hard Snake Scale] which you can get from [Lamia]. This will be your last favor. Thank you for all your work.\n\n[Lamia] upon request of Aladdin and Local Rod Elmo Sharks captain of the port, bring in from [solid snake scales]."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "It's the last mission. Can you do a little better?"
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_514
    If player is elmorad
        Say "It's the last mission. Can you do a little better?"
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_513

On claimable
    Show quest "Well ... The quality is very good. Good.\n\nCould you help that fool for the last time? Please deliver [Armor Material Box] to [Blacksmith] of Moradon. This will be the last delivery. But please bring me the receipt!"
